-----------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components
-----------------------------------------------------------------------

lib/bessel_module.f90 contains the routines jyna, jy01b, msta1, msta2
and envj, which are copyrighted by Shanjie Zhang and Jianming Jin and
are taken from their book "Computation of Special Functions" (Wiley,
1996).  The authors give permission to incorporate those routines into
a user program provided that the copyright is acknowledged; the file
carries that acknowledgement in its header.  They have been adapted in
form only (wrapped in a module, given the module kind parameter, and
with the external-function declarations a module makes unnecessary
removed); no arithmetic was changed.

Everything else in this distribution is under the MIT License above.
